<title>HUNGARY: Hungary one-month T-bill yield rises to 20.12 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary one-month T-bill yield rises to 20.12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's one-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 20.12 percent on Tuesday, up from 19.90 percent set at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	2,523.78 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    20.12 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     98.4800 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
